* **Database & Querying:** MySQL Workbench (Views, Aggregate Functions, Conditional CASE Statements, Subqueries)
* **Data Transformation:** Microsoft Excel, Power Query
* **Business Intelligence:** Power BI Desktop (DAX Expressions, Custom Gauge Visuals, Donut Charts, Strategic Text Cards)
